{"id":15,"source":"api.quran.com/v4/quran/verses/uthmani_tajweed","updated":"2026-08-23","verses":[{"id":1,"tajweed":"ا<span class=\"tj tj-madda_necessary\">لٓ</span>ر‌ۚ تِلْكَ ءَايَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكِتَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>بِ وَقُرْءَا<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">نٍ م</span>ُّب<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١</span>"},{"id":2,"tajweed":"رُّبَمَا يَوَدُّ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> لَوْ كَانُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> مُسْلِم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢</span>"},{"id":3,"tajweed":"ذَرْهُمْ يَأْكُلُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> وَيَتَمَتَّعُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> وَيُلْهِهِمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَمَلُ‌ۖ فَسَوْفَ يَعْلَم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣</span>"},{"id":4,"tajweed":"وَم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَهْلَكْنَا مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ق</span>َرْيَةٍ إِلَّا وَلَهَا كِتَا<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">بٌ م</span>َّعْل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>مٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤</span>"},{"id":5,"tajweed":"مَّا تَسْبِقُ مِنْ أُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َةٍ أَجَلَهَا وَمَا يَسْتَــْٔخِر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٥</span>"},{"id":6,"tajweed":"وَقَالُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> يَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ـٰٓ</span>أَيُّهَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى نُزِّلَ عَلَيْهِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>ذِّكْرُ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َكَ لَمَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>ن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نٌ <spa